{"id": "rule-presales-product", "category": "route_rule_hit", "session_id": "eval-rule-presales-product", "messages": ["显示器多少钱"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "contains": ["1899"]}, "notes": "规则命中「多少钱」，售前 Profile 查询商品价格，回复应包含实际价格。"}
{"id": "rule-presales-laptop", "category": "route_rule_hit", "session_id": "eval-rule-presales-laptop", "messages": ["笔记本多少钱"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "contains": ["5999"]}, "notes": "商品关键词命中售前；验证 Mock 与真实 LLM 都能给出价格信息。"}
{"id": "rule-order-status", "category": "route_rule_hit", "session_id": "eval-rule-order-status", "messages": ["查订单 20261101001"], "expect": {"route_agent": "order", "contains": ["已发货"]}, "notes": "规则命中「订单」，订单 Profile 返回订单状态；用固定订单号保证可复现。"}
{"id": "rule-order-logistics", "category": "route_rule_hit", "session_id": "eval-rule-order-logistics", "messages": ["单号 SF2000000001 到哪了"], "expect": {"route_agent": "order", "contains": ["物流轨迹"]}, "notes": "规则命中「单号/到哪了」，验证物流查询链路。"}
{"id": "rule-after-sales-intent", "category": "route_rule_hit", "session_id": "eval-rule-after-sales-intent", "messages": ["我要退款"], "expect": {"route_agent": "after_sales"}, "notes": "规则命中「退款」，售后 Profile 必须接住写操作意图；该任务只校验路由。"}
{"id": "llm-route-vague-product", "category": "route_llm_fallback", "session_id": "eval-llm-route-vague-product", "messages": ["帮我看看这个东西怎么样"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales"}, "only_real_llm": true, "notes": "模糊咨询没有规则关键词，需要 LLM 兜底判断为售前；Mock 模式跳过。"}
{"id": "llm-route-vague-after-sales", "category": "route_llm_fallback", "session_id": "eval-llm-route-vague-after-sales", "messages": ["我昨天买的东西出了点问题，你们打算怎么解决"], "expect": {"route_agent": "after_sales"}, "only_real_llm": true, "notes": "模糊的售后诉求依赖 LLM 语义判断；同时验证 LLM 路由不可用时的默认回退不会崩。"}
{"id": "pending-confirm", "category": "pending_flow", "session_id": "eval-pending-confirm", "messages": ["订单 20261101001 我要退款", "确认退款"], "expect": {"route_agent": "after_sales", "no_write_tools": false}, "only_real_llm": true, "notes": "两阶段确认：首轮创建 pending，次轮确认执行；MockLLM 不会发起写工具，因此仅真实模式运行。"}
{"id": "pending-reject", "category": "pending_flow", "session_id": "eval-pending-reject", "messages": ["订单 20261101002 我要取消订单", "先不要取消了"], "expect": {"route_agent": "after_sales", "no_write_tools": false}, "only_real_llm": true, "notes": "两阶段拒绝：创建 pending 后用户反悔，验证 reject 路径与 pending 粘滞。"}
{"id": "pending-expire", "category": "pending_flow", "session_id": "eval-pending-expire", "messages": ["订单 20261101003 我要退款", "确认"], "expect": {"route_agent": "after_sales", "no_write_tools": false, "errors_allowed": ["confirmation_expired"]}, "only_real_llm": true, "inject": {"type": "confirmation_ttl", "value": 0}, "notes": "把 pending TTL 临时设为 0，确认时触发 confirmation_expired，验证过期状态机。"}
{"id": "cache-presales-repeat", "category": "cache_hit", "session_id": "eval-cache-presales-repeat", "messages": ["显示器多少钱", "显示器多少钱"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "cache_hit": true, "contains": ["1899"]}, "notes": "同一售前消息连续两次，第二次应命中归一化消息缓存并跳过 LLM。"}
{"id": "cache-order-repeat", "category": "cache_hit", "session_id": "eval-cache-order-repeat", "messages": ["查订单 20261101001", "查订单 20261101001"], "expect": {"route_agent": "order", "cache_hit": true, "contains": ["已发货"]}, "notes": "订单 Profile 也在白名单内；重复查询应命中缓存（TTL 更短，但同一任务内有效）。"}
{"id": "cache-presales-lamp", "category": "cache_hit", "session_id": "eval-cache-presales-lamp", "messages": ["护眼台灯多少钱", "护眼台灯多少钱"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "cache_hit": true, "contains": ["129"]}, "notes": "换一个商品验证缓存 key 不受商品类别影响，只由稳定前缀 + 归一化消息决定。"}
{"id": "cache-miss-after-sales", "category": "cache_miss_not_cached", "session_id": "eval-cache-miss-after-sales", "messages": ["我要退款", "我要退款"], "expect": {"route_agent": "after_sales", "cache_hit": false}, "notes": "after_sales 不在缓存白名单：即使全局开启也不应命中，避免复用写操作状态。"}
{"id": "cache-miss-short-message", "category": "cache_miss_not_cached", "session_id": "eval-cache-miss-short-message", "messages": ["好", "好"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "cache_hit": false}, "notes": "短消息低于 NMSG_MIN_LENGTH，不查也不写缓存，防止「好」「嗯」互相命中。"}
{"id": "cache-miss-pure-number", "category": "cache_miss_not_cached", "session_id": "eval-cache-miss-pure-number", "messages": ["20261101001", "20261101001"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "cache_hit": false}, "notes": "纯数字消息不缓存：订单号/单号本身没有复用价值。"}
{"id": "cache-miss-cancel-intent", "category": "cache_miss_not_cached", "session_id": "eval-cache-miss-cancel-intent", "messages": ["我要取消", "我要取消"], "expect": {"route_agent": "after_sales", "cache_hit": false}, "notes": "售后取消意图同样不缓存；与退款任务一起覆盖 after_sales 的多种表述。"}
{"id": "error-tool-exception", "category": "error_path", "session_id": "eval-error-tool-exception", "messages": ["查订单 20261101001"], "expect": {"route_agent": "order", "errors_allowed": ["tool_failed"]}, "inject": {"type": "tool_error", "tool": "query_order"}, "notes": "注入数据源异常，验证工具失败被映射为 tool_failed、响应为统一错误体。"}
{"id": "error-llm-timeout", "category": "error_path", "session_id": "eval-error-llm-timeout", "messages": ["显示器多少钱"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "errors_allowed": ["llm_failed"]}, "inject": {"type": "llm_error"}, "notes": "注入 LLM 超时，验证错误分类为 llm_failed 且路由事件仍然完整。"}
{"id": "error-route-fallback", "category": "error_path", "session_id": "eval-error-route-fallback", "messages": ["显示器多少钱"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "contains": ["1899"]}, "inject": {"type": "route_exception"}, "notes": "路由抛异常时回退默认 Profile 且不中断请求；该任务不允许出现错误事件。"}
{"id": "boundary-empty-message", "category": "boundary_input", "session_id": "eval-boundary-empty-message", "messages": [""], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "contains": ["暂时没理解"]}, "notes": "空消息：接口不报错，走默认 Profile 与兜底回复。"}
{"id": "boundary-long-message", "category": "boundary_input", "session_id": "eval-boundary-long-message", "messages": ["我想咨询一下，你们店里这款显示器我看介绍说是27英寸4K分辨率，支持HDR吗，色域覆盖怎么样，和同价位的其他型号比哪个更值得买，我家里的桌子大概一米二宽，放得下吗，平时主要用来修图和看视频，偶尔也玩一些游戏，显卡是几年前买的，不知道带不带得动，另外就是支架能不能升降，壁挂孔位是什么标准，接口有几个HDMI和DP，有没有Type-C，能不能给平板充电，保修是几年，坏了怎么修，发票能不能开，运费怎么算，多久能发货，现在下单有没有优惠，最后再问一下显示器多少钱"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "contains": ["1899"]}, "notes": "超长消息：验证截断/组装不会丢失关键实体，仍能查询到商品。"}
{"id": "boundary-unknown-order", "category": "boundary_input", "session_id": "eval-boundary-unknown-order", "messages": ["12345678901"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "contains": ["没有查到该订单"]}, "notes": "不存在的订单号：业务失败是正常返回值，不应抛异常或伪造订单信息。"}
{"id": "boundary-punctuation-only", "category": "boundary_input", "session_id": "eval-boundary-punctuation-only", "messages": ["？？？"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "contains": ["抱歉"]}, "notes": "纯标点：归一化后为空，不进入缓存也不应报错，走兜底回复。"}
{"id": "subset-presales-product", "category": "tool_subset", "session_id": "eval-subset-presales-product", "messages": ["机械键盘有货吗"], "expect": {"route_agent": "pre_sales", "contains": ["349"]}, "notes": "售前子集：通过商品查询行为间接验证 pre_sales 只应触达商品/FAQ 工具。"}
{"id": "subset-order-logistics", "category": "tool_subset", "session_id": "eval-subset-order-logistics", "messages": ["快递单号 YT2000000003 到哪了"], "expect": {"route_agent": "order", "contains": ["物流轨迹"]}, "notes": "订单子集：物流单号应命中 order Profile 的物流工具。"}
{"id": "subset-order-status", "category": "tool_subset", "session_id": "eval-subset-order-status", "messages": ["订单 20261102002 到哪了"], "expect": {"route_agent": "order", "contains": ["待收货"]}, "notes": "订单子集：订单号查询应返回状态字段，验证工具子集与 Profile 的一致性。"}
